DISTINGUISHING NOTE
Variable shadowing (a local x hiding a global x) is a smaller cousin of this same displacement idea,
but MRO is the one that is genuinely a fixed, memorized-in-spirit ranking used to predict eviction
ahead of time — not just a per-call, per-scope accident.
Where the chemistry book's Activity Series needed three separate ladders (cation reactivity, halogen displacement, radical
stability) because each tracked a different currency, MRO stays a single ladder — Python only has one lookup mechanism to
rank, not three independent phenomena.
